msgid "Biz haqimizda"
msgstr "About Us"

msgid ""
"Take Avia Trip haqida — 2025-yilda tashkil etilgan, aviabilet va tur "
"paketlari sohasida ishonchli hamkor. Kompaniyamiz, missiyamiz va nima uchun "
"mijozlar bizni tanlaydi."
msgstr ""
"About Take Avia Trip — founded in 2025, a trusted partner for flight tickets"
" and tour packages. Learn about our company, our mission, and why customers "
"choose us."

msgid "Bosh sahifaga qaytish"
msgstr "Back to home"

msgid ""
"Take Avia Trip — sizning ishonchli sayohat hamrohingiz. Aviabiletlar va tur "
"paketlarni qulay narxlarda, aniq va o'z vaqtida tashkil etamiz."
msgstr ""
"Take Avia Trip is your trusted travel companion. We arrange flights and tour"
" packages at great prices, accurately and on time."

msgid "Kompaniya haqida"
msgstr "About the company"

msgid ""
"TAKE AVIA TRIP 2025-yilda tashkil etilgan bo'lib, qisqa vaqt ichida ko'plab "
"mijozlarning ishonchini qozonishga va ijobiy fikr-mulohazalarga ega "
"bo'lishga muvaffaq bo'ldi. Kompaniyamizning asosiy maqsadi — har bir mijozga"
" aviaqatnovlar va sayohatlar sohasida qulay, ishonchli hamda puxta tashkil "
"etilgan xizmatlarni taqdim etish."
msgstr ""
"TAKE AVIA TRIP was founded in 2025, and within a short time has earned the "
"trust of many customers along with positive feedback. Our company's main "
"goal is to provide every customer with convenient, reliable and carefully "
"organized services in air travel and tourism."

msgid ""
"Biz aviachiptalarni bron qilish, turli yo'nalishlar bo'yicha turlarni "
"tanlash, mehmonxonalarni bron qilish, transferlarni tashkil etish, "
"shuningdek, sayohat bilan bog'liq barcha masalalar bo'yicha professional "
"maslahatlar berish kabi keng ko'lamli xizmatlarni taklif etamiz. Har bir "
"mijozning istaklari, afzalliklari va ehtiyojlaridan kelib chiqib, eng maqbul"
" va manfaatli yechimlarni individual tarzda tanlashga intilamiz."
msgstr ""
"We offer a wide range of services: booking flight tickets, selecting tours "
"across various destinations, booking hotels, arranging transfers, and "
"professional advice on all travel-related matters. Based on each customer's "
"wishes, preferences and needs, we strive to select the most suitable and "
"beneficial solutions individually."

msgid ""
"TAKE AVIA TRIP jamoasi sayohatning har bir bosqichida qulaylik, aniqlik va "
"ishonchlilikka alohida e'tibor qaratadi. Biz uchun sayohat — shunchaki "
"manzilga yetib borish emas, balki yoqimli taassurotlar, xotirjamlik va "
"sifatli xizmat uyg'unligidir. Shu sababli har bir murojaatga katta "
"mas'uliyat bilan yondashib, mijozlarimizga qulay aviareyslar, manfaatli "
"shartlar va yuqori darajadagi xizmatni taklif etamiz."
msgstr ""
"The TAKE AVIA TRIP team pays special attention to convenience, accuracy and "
"reliability at every stage of the journey. For us, travel isn't just about "
"reaching a destination — it's the combination of pleasant impressions, peace"
" of mind and quality service. That's why we treat every request with great "
"responsibility, offering our customers convenient flights, favorable terms "
"and a high level of service."

msgid ""
"Bizning asosiy tamoyillarimiz — sifat, tezkorlik, ishonchlilik va mijozlarga"
" g'amxo'rlik. Ana shu yondashuv tufayli TAKE AVIA TRIP shunchaki xizmat "
"ko'rsatuvchi kompaniya emas, balki sayohatda qulaylik va ishonchni "
"qadrlaydigan har bir inson uchun ishonchli hamkorga aylanmoqda."
msgstr ""
"Our core principles are quality, speed, reliability and care for our "
"customers. Thanks to this approach, TAKE AVIA TRIP is becoming more than "
"just a service company — it's a trusted partner for everyone who values "
"comfort and confidence in travel."

msgid ""
"TAKE AVIA TRIP — qulay parvozlar, ishonchli xizmat va unutilmas sayohatlar "
"sari to'g'ri tanlov."
msgstr ""
"TAKE AVIA TRIP — the right choice for comfortable flights, reliable service "
"and unforgettable journeys."

msgid "TAKE AVIA TRIP asoschisi — Rejabov Dostonbek Baxtiyorjon o'g'li."
msgstr "Founder of TAKE AVIA TRIP — Rejabov Dostonbek Bakhtiyorjon o'g'li."

