msgstr "Get in touch with our team — we'll help you plan your trip."

msgid "Bog'lanish"
msgstr "Contact"

msgid ""
"Take Avia Trip bilan bog'laning — telefon, email yoki xabar qoldiring, "
"menejerlarimiz tez orada aloqaga chiqadi. Manzil: Mirzo Ulug'bek tumani, "
"Toshkent."
msgstr ""
"Contact Take Avia Trip — leave your phone, email or a message and our "
"managers will get back to you shortly. Address: Mirzo Ulugbek district, "
"Tashkent."

msgid ""
"Savollaringiz bormi yoki sayohatingizni rejalashtirmoqchimisiz? "
"Menejerlarimiz sizga yordam berishga tayyor."
msgstr ""
"Have questions or want to plan your trip? Our managers are ready to help."

